{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>9to5Mac 由 CleanMyMac by MacPaw 呈獻。隨住 macOS 27 Golden Gate 推出，記得先用 CleanMyMac 清理空間同優化系統，確保你部新 Mac 用第一日就發揮到 100% 效能。了解更多。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 比起 macOS 26 Tahoe 係一個重大升級，而且唔單止係設計上更聰明咁簡單。就好似 iPhone 嘅 iOS 27 一樣，Mac 加入咗 Liquid Glass 透明度滑桿，等你可以大幅改變成個系統嘅外觀。</p>\n<h2>滑桿</h2>\n<p>Liquid Glass 係 Apple 嘅設計語言，由 iOS 26 同 macOS 26 Tahoe 開始採用。最初 Liquid Glass 只有一種外觀，Apple 後來加入咗一個設定，可以令 Liquid Glass 冇咁透明。</p>\n<p>由 iOS 27 同 macOS 27 Golden Gate 開始，Liquid Glass 唔再局限於兩種風格。Apple 改為引入一個外觀滑桿，等你可以將 Liquid Glass 調得比以前更加透明，亦可以調到更朦朧但仍保持現代感嘅效果。</p>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate 預設採用中等設定，系統喺首次設定時亦會提示你調整滑桿。你之後亦可以喺「系統設定 &gt; 外觀」入面再調整。</p>\n<p>Liquid Glass 滑桿會實時預覽每個設定嘅效果。三個刻度分別代表最透明、中等同最朦朧，但你亦可以自由調較兩個刻度之間嘅任何位置。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Ultraclear.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Default.webp?w=800\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-System-Settings-Fully-Tinted.webp?w=800\"/>\n<h2>Dock 欄</h2>\n<p>Dock 欄係最明顯會跟住 Liquid Glass 滑桿設定而改變外觀嘅元素。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<p>佢嘅範圍可以由清楚顯示你嘅桌面背景圖案，到變成一塊更朦朧、更實在嘅材質。</p>\n<p>下面係近距離睇嘅效果：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Ultraclear.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Default.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Fully-Tinted.webp\"/>\n<h2>小工具</h2>\n<p>macOS 桌面小工具可以全彩、調暗，或者自動變色。Liquid Glass 滑桿亦會改變小工具調暗時嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Widgets-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<h2>Apple Music 同 Podcast</h2>\n<p>Apple Music 同 Podcast 等有系統「播放中」欄嘅應用程式，會因應 Liquid Glass 滑桿嘅位置而呈現截然不同嘅外觀。</p>\n<p>以 Podcast 嘅「播放中」欄為例：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>而 Music 嘅就係：</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Music-Now-Playing-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<h2>更多</h2>\n<p>滑桿亦會套用喺側邊欄、工具列同工具列按鈕上，改變「照片」、Safari 同其他有視窗介面嘅應用程式嘅外觀。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-03.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Photos-Comparison-01.webp\"/>\n<p>macOS 27 Golden Gate Liquid Glass 滑桿有一點要留意，就係單一滑桿控制成個系統嘅所有 Liquid Glass 外觀。即係話 Dock 欄、小工具同視窗介面都會係同一種風格。</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-01.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-02.webp\"/>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/macOS-27-Liquid-Glass-Dock-Five-Apps-Additional-03.webp\"/>\n<p>你鍾意邊種？更透明、更朦朧，定係兩者之間？我個人就好鍾意更朦朧嗰個選項喺我部 Mac 上面睇落成熟又靚。不過有時玩下更透明嘅效果都幾有趣，我好高興 macOS 27 Golden Gate 畀大家自由揀。</p>\n<p>喺留言區分享你嘅想法啦！</p>\n<img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/09/CMM-Body-Image-1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T11:00:17.193455+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1200,"images":25,"source":"9to5Mac","fallback":"none"}}